# `threenative build` recompiles assets/ into public/ (KTX2, meshopt, content-hashed names).
# Every byte under these is derived from assets/ and regenerated by `pnpm build`.
public/assets.manifest.json
public/bake.receipt.json
public/basis/
public/fab/

# UE Viewer writes its per-package error log into whatever directory the importer ran from.
notify.log

# ANIMAL VARIETY PACK (Fab listing 2dd7964c-a601-4264-a53d-465dcae1644c) and everything derived
# from it. `fab_get_asset` reports its licences as Fab Standard Personal and Professional, which
# do not permit redistributing a pack's assets as standalone files, and this remote is public.
# The same call the repository root already makes for Landscape Pro. tools/import-wolf-ab.mjs is
# committed instead: anyone who owns the pack regenerates both arms in one command.
public/wolf-ab/
